# REC tapped in HOME, stopped: `rec` at once, a bar's count-in, then a take
# of two keys (live input, `non`/`nof`), REC again to stop recording, and
# PLAY/STOP. The take plays back on the next passes.
--button 0.10:REC
--key 1.30:7:100:0.2
--key 1.60:11:90:0.2
--button 2.60:REC
--button 3.50:PLAY/STOP
